  "description": "Every year, the Sturmvogel EVO proves that comfort and everyday functionality do not have to come at the expense of style. Thanks to the monocoque casting process, the chic aluminium frame has become even more elegant in the new model year – and features two additional highlights in the form of integrated MonkeyLink cornering lights and twin lights in the dropouts. This ensures maximum visibility and visibility on all routes at all times. The latest generation of the Bosch Performance Line CX motor provides that extra bit of riding pleasure in everyday life – and thanks to the combination of Shimano Nexus 5-speed hub and belt drive, maintenance is reduced to a minimum. Together with the wide Schwalbe G-One tyres, this creates the perfect mix of safety, comfort and riding pleasure – with great looks as an added bonus.",
